                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 2,
                  "html": "Kweku<br>",
                  "align": "center",
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "Images created with Eden and Midjourney",
                  "align": "center",
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "Kweku explores the extensive network of lava tubes beneath the Martian surface. These tubes, remnants of ancient volcanic activity, offer a stark contrast to the cold and barren Martian surface. Kweku uses geothermal energy from Mars' subsurface to support his activities and to study the potential for these environments to support life. The thermal gradients present in the tubes help drive the chemical reactions needed to sustain life, enabling Kweku to experiment with and nurture microbial colonies.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "span": 3,
              "content": []
            }
