              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 2,
                  "html": "Mycos",
                  "align": "center",
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "Images created with Eden and Midjourney",
                  "align": "center",
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "Mycos inhabits Sporion, an asteroid comet hybrid that has been transformed into a life-supporting ark. Utilizing the asteroid's geothermal energy and rich mineral deposits, Mycos cultivates a diverse ecosystem. Radiotrophic fungi within this system convert radiation into chemical energy, a crucial adaptation in the absence of sunlight. This enables Mycos to sustain life in a seemingly barren space environment.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "span": 3,
              "content": []
            }
          ]
